# Build tools for locked packages that publish no Python 3.15 wheel, so a clean
# install builds them from their hash-checked sdist. Today that is PyYAML 6.0.3,
# whose sdist build needs setuptools and Cython 3. build-constraints.txt pins and
# hash-checks them; README.md (Development) has the command that regenerates it.
setuptools
cython>=3.0
